{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e396688f4f66c56c","name":"Corellian Crix-Class Assault Shuttle","source":{"id":"source:reference-e396688f4f66c56c","title":"Corellian Crix-Class Assault Shuttle","revision":20119,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:15:13Z","sha256":"809efc61361ccaa4761995333fb674bb8a94f8236993f0c4e7e7569b55b08171","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20119","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Corellian%20Crix-Class%20Assault%20Shuttle&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e396688f4f66c56c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Crix"]},"-Class Shuttle is one of the mainstays of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," military and diplomatic services. The shuttle features a heavily armored split-shell design that encases most of the vessel. The armor provides excellent protection from attacks above or below, leaving a relatively narrow slot between the shells that exposes the engines, cockpit, and sides of the ship. A tall, vertical fin houses powerful long-range communications sensors. Like so many of Corellian Engineering Corporation's designs, the shuttle is easily modified to support many different civilian and military roles as well as different classes of passenger comfort. Two primary versions are in use by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"},": the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Corellian ",{"tag":"i","children":["Crix"]},"-Class Courier Shuttle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Corellian_Crix-Class_Courier_Shuttle","referenceId":"reference:3da49daafd124ef9"}," (DC-4a) and the Corellian ",{"tag":"i","children":["Crix"]},"-Class Assault Shuttle (A-2s).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The shuttle's design showcases its lineage as a joint effort between the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dac","referenceId":"reference:8654fc7bdc8fd9cb"}," shipyards and the Corellian Engineering Corporation. The armored shell's shape and surface blisters are common to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," craft, while the ship's engine, bridge, and interior recall features of the successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Corellian Corvette"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Corellian_Corvette"},". Even the ship's class designation shares a history with both company's homeworlds; Rebel and New Republic hero ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crix Madine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crix_Madine","referenceId":"reference:270cd2b6bef67728"}," was born on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Corellia"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Corellia","referenceId":"reference:b23d752dcc50dee4"},", and later helped to defend ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dac","referenceId":"reference:8654fc7bdc8fd9cb"}," against the reborn Emperor's World Devastators.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Assault Shuttle carries heavier armor and better shielding, as well as much heavier firepower. The area between the upper and lower shells is ringed by a series of additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Cannons"},", enabling the ship to form its own perimeter of fire when on the ground in hostile territory. Troopers aboard the ship may fire these cannons, or they can be set to automatic fire, which reduces their accuracy. Four boarding ramps allow the rapid deployment of troops and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeders","referenceId":"reference:be93ac2e4867f0ca"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Corellian ",{"tag":"i","children":["Crix"]},"-Class Assault Shuttle Statistics (CL 15)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +0; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 20 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 16), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 31; +16 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 200; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 15; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 50 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Regenerating Shields"],"href":"https://